Nethack currently ranks your troubles like this:

#define TROUBLE_STONED 10
#define TROUBLE_STRANGLED 9
#define TROUBLE_LAVA 8
#define TROUBLE_SICK 7
#define TROUBLE_STARVING 6
#define TROUBLE_HIT 5
#define TROUBLE_LYCANTHROPE 4
#define TROUBLE_STUCK_IN_WALL 3
#define TROUBLE_CURSED_BLINDFOLD 2
#define TROUBLE_CURSED_LEVITATION 1

#define TROUBLE_PUNISHED (-1)
#define TROUBLE_CURSED_ITEMS (-2)
#define TROUBLE_BLIND (-3)
#define TROUBLE_HUNGRY (-4)
#define TROUBLE_POISONED (-5)
#define TROUBLE_WOUNDED_LEGS (-6)
#define TROUBLE_STUNNED (-7)
#define TROUBLE_CONFUSED (-8)
#define TROUBLE_HALLUCINATION (-9)

If you pray, you god will (depending on your luck, and how much your 
god likes you):
1) Give you a present and fix all the troubles
2) Fix all your troubles
3) Fix your worst trouble, and all your troubles > 0 (above)
4) Fix all your troubles > 0
5) Fix your worst trouble if > 0, otherwise nothing
6) Do nothing.

I think that if you're stridently aligned, and your luck is maxed
out, you've got a pretty good chance of getting everything fixed. 
If you're standing on an altar, the odds are even beter.
